Package: seuratflow
Title: Seurat Preprocessing Workflow with Built-in Quality Control Reports
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Wiktor", "Mikolajczak", , "93826754+wiktormiko@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Helpers that automate a Seurat (v5) single-cell RNA-seq
    preprocessing workflow: parallel reading of 10X matrix, 10X h5 and
    CellBender output with per-cell quality control (MAD-based outlier flags and
    optional doublet detection), log-normalization or SCTransform with Harmony
    integration, resolution selection (clustree and silhouette scores), marker
    detection with DotPlots at every resolution, and ggplot2 themes for UMAPs.
    Quality control tables, plots and parameters are written to a
    'QualityControl' folder with automatically sized figures.
